alex: thanks. So we have better medians/cost but tail and hallucination problems. Proposed automatic fallback config for the canary-controller (pseudo-JSON):
```
{
  "stages": [0.5, 2, 10],
  "window_minutes": 30,
  "persistence_windows": 2,    // require trigger to hold for 2 consecutive windows before fallback
  "triggers": {
    "mrr_absolute_drop": 0.008,   // 0.8% absolute
    "hallucination_pp_delta": 0.015,
    "longdoc_trunc_error": 0.004,
    "p99_latency_rel_increase": 0.20
  },
  "ignore_filters": ["queries.tokens > 2000"],
  "post_fallback": {
    "retain_shadow_compare": 1000,  // keep diffs for 1k requests
    "cooldown_minutes": 60
  }
}
```
